map.：中型犬（系数 1.0）：第 1 年 15 岁 + 第 2 年 9 岁 = 24:
Medium dog (factor 1.0): year 1 gives 15 years + year 2 gives 9 years = 24, then +5 per year -> 24 + (5-2)x5 = 39 years;
Small dog (factor 0.85, +4 per year) -> 24 + 3x4 = 36 years;
Giant dog (factor 1.3, +7 per year) -> 24 + 3x7 = 45 years;
Cat (fixed +4 per year) -> 24 + (5-2)x4 = 36 years.
